        "$\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\frac{(n+1)^2}{2^{n+1}}\\cdot\\frac{2^n}{n^2}=\\left(\\frac{n+1}{n}\\right)^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}$。",
        "$\\frac{n+1}{n}\\to 1$，所以 $L=\\frac{1}{2}<1$。",
        "收斂。"
      ],
      "answer": "收斂",
      "claim": "LIM(((x+1)^2/2^(x+1))/(x^2/2^x), inf) == 1/2"
    },
    {
      "title": "階乘配 $n^n$",
      "prompt": "$\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty\\frac{n!}{n^n}$ 收斂嗎？",
      "problemId": "lec-13-m2",
      "steps": [
        "$\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\frac{(n+1)!}{(n+1)^{n+1}}\\cdot\\frac{n^n}{n!}=\\frac{(n+1)\\cdot n^n}{(n+1)^{n+1}}=\\frac{n^n}{(n+1)^n}=\\left(\\frac{n}{n+1}\\right)^n$。",
        "$\\left(\\frac{n}{n+1}\\right)^n=\\frac{1}{(1+1/n)^n}\\to\\frac{1}{e}\\approx 0.368<1$。",
        "收斂。"
      ],
      "answer": "收斂（$L=\\frac{1}{e}$）",
      "claim": "LIM((x/(x+1))^x, inf) == e^(-1)"
