      "steps": [
        "$\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\frac{(n+1)^{n+1}}{(n+1)!}\\cdot\\frac{n!}{n^n}=\\frac{(n+1)^n}{n^n}=\\left(1+\\frac{1}{n}\\right)^n$。",
        "$\\to e\\approx 2.718>1$。",
        "發散。（其實 $\\frac{n^n}{n!}\\ge 1$，各項根本不趨近 0。）"
      ],
      "answer": "發散（$L=e$）",
      "claim": "LIM((1+1/x)^x, inf) == e"
    }
